@name     macro_delete
@alias    /m
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_macro_delete
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  delete defined user macro
@doc
Removes user macro definition specified by string bracket.
Usage: [name] /m
@code
    return skode_exec_slashm(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
